Description: Implements Claim-Scoped Diagnostic Gates (CSDG) for planning,
    executing, documenting, and exporting diagnostics for interpretable
    machine-learning analyses. The package integrates with the 'mlr3'
    ecosystem and separates predictive performance, measurement and
    preprocessing review, dependence and support, calibration, local
    faithfulness, explanation stability, model and setting generalization,
    and subgroup auditing. The existing AutoIML workflow remains available
    for compatibility. Diagnostic status labels describe the available
    evidence and do not certify causal validity or deployment readiness.
